WEBVTT

00:54:27.821 --> 00:54:30.133
EG: It is dust to dust, ashes to ashes,

00:54:30.157 --> 00:54:32.234
and it's amazing.

00:54:32.258 --> 00:54:34.703
You know?

00:54:34.727 --> 00:54:39.914
So I don't see any reason to know
that it's dust to dust, ashes to ashes

00:54:39.938 --> 00:54:43.133
and not also think
that it's extraordinary.

00:54:43.157 --> 00:54:46.770
It's incredible that we get to do this.

00:54:46.794 --> 00:54:51.132
It's incredible that we get to come here
and experience consciousness,

00:54:51.156 --> 00:54:53.946
and we still don't even know
what the hell that is, and --

00:54:53.970 --> 00:54:55.136
CA: We don't.

00:54:55.160 --> 00:54:58.095
EG: We don't. We're no closer
to knowing it than we ever were,

00:54:58.119 --> 00:55:01.268
and we don't know why we have
these extraordinary sensitivities